### ==================== IdSearch — 从数据库按 contentId 查 ====================

### 1. IdSearch — 登录用户查询，应含 isFollow
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search/IdSearch
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "contentId": 70
}


### 2. IdSearch — 未登录用户查询
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search/IdSearch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1
}


### 3. IdSearch — 查询不存在的 content
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search/IdSearch
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "contentId": 99999
}


### ==================== keywordSearch — 全文搜索 ====================

### 4. keywordSearch — 登录用户搜索
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search/keywordSearch
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "keyword": "红烧肉"
}


### 5. keywordSearch — 未登录用户搜索
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search/keywordSearch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyword": "太刀"
}


### 6. keywordSearch — 搜索不存在的关键词
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search/keywordSearch
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "keyword": "xyz不存在的关键词123"
}


### 7. keywordSearch — keyword 为空
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search/keywordSearch
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "keyword": ""
}


### ==================== getDetailRecommended — 从缓存取详情 ====================

### 8. getDetail — 登录用户从缓存获取
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search/getDetailRecommended
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "contentId": 1
}


### 9. getDetail — 未登录用户从缓存获取
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search/getDetailRecommended
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1
}


### ==================== 异常路径 ====================

### 10. 缺少 action
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "keyword": "test"
}


### 11. IdSearch — contentId 为非数字
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search/IdSearch
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "contentId": "abc"
}


### 12. IdSearch — 缺少 contentId
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search/IdSearch
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
}


### 13. keywordSearch — 缺少 keyword 字段
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search/keywordSearch
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
}

### ==================== 单字搜索（LIKE 回退）====================

### 14. keywordSearch — 单字搜索
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search/keywordSearch
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "keyword": "火"
}

### 15. keywordSearch — 单字搜索（GET 参数）
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search/keywordSearch?keyword=火
token: {{token}}

### ==================== 分页搜索 ====================

### 16. keywordSearch — 分页第1页，每页5条
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search/keywordSearch?keyword=游戏&page=1&pageSize=5
token: {{token}}

### 17. keywordSearch — 分页第2页，每页5条
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search/keywordSearch?keyword=游戏&page=2&pageSize=5
token: {{token}}

### 18. keywordSearch — 默认分页（page=1, pageSize=12）
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search/keywordSearch?keyword=美食
token: {{token}}
